    <user>dimstar_suse</user>
    <comment>New package: zlib-rs 0.6.7

Memory-safe implementation of the zlib compression algorithms in Rust,
exposing the standard zlib C API as libz_rs. Installed alongside the system
zlib rather than replacing it; consumers opt in by linking -lz_rs.

Only the libz-rs-sys-cdylib C dynamic library is built, via cargo-c. The gz*
entry points are enabled; gzprintf is not, as it requires the unstable
c_variadic feature. No headers are shipped, so the package cannot collide
with zlib-devel.</comment>
